<title>USA: Metropolitan Pier Authority $505 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Metropolitan Pier Authority $505 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it priced a Metropolitan Pier and Exposition Authority, Ill., $505 million bond issue for McCormick Place expansion project refunding, Series 1996A, with a top yield of 6.15 percent in 2025 in the capital appreciation bond portion of the offering.</p>
